{
  "$schema": "./recipe-schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "schemaVersion": "3.1.0",
    "component": "card",
    "version": "3.2.1",
    "status": "stable",
    "tags": [
      "container",
      "surface",
      "interactive",
      "layout"
    ],
    "links": {
      "figma": "",
      "storybook": "",
      "docs": "/docs/card-docs"
    },
    "changelog": [
      {
        "version": "3.2.1",
        "changes": [
          "06.10.2026 (Entscheidung card-auswahl, \"Zarte Toenung\"): Gewaehlte Selectable-Karte (:has(.nc-card__input:checked)) ohne Akzentflaeche. --nc-card-selected-bg ist jetzt eine Toenung (interactive-default 8 %), die als Schicht ueber der Kartenflaeche liegt; Rahmen und Ring (interactive-default, 2px) zeigen die Auswahl. Meta-Zeile in der gewaehlten Karte in Sekundaertext. Gemessen: Flaeche hell rgb(238,238,238), dunkel rgb(57,59,57); Texte hell >= 5,84:1 (Titel 15,39:1), dunkel >= 5,28:1 (Titel 10,13:1). Vorher Sekundaertext auf accent-600 2,76:1 (hell), auf accent-400 1,47:1 und Titel 1,3:1 (dunkel). Freigabe ausstehend."
        ]
      },
      {
        "version": "3.2.0",
        "changes": [
          "06.10.2026: Achse context gebaut (Entscheidung 06.10.2026, nur tight/display): .nc-card--tight und .nc-card--display in scss/scss/06-molecules/_card.scss setzen die Karten-Tokens der Gruppen context-tight/context-display (Padding, Titel-/Beschreibungsgroesse) — keine Flaechenregeln. Vorher beschrieben, aber ohne SCSS.",
          "06.10.2026: dependencyRules tight-grid-context/few-columns-display nennen die gebauten Werte (vorher --fnd-spacing-sm/-xl, die es nicht gibt, und fs-sm/fs-lg)."
        ]
      },
      {
        "version": "3.1.0",
        "changes": [
          "Arena aus dem Recipe (Plan v3, Phase 3, Block Inhalte): Vorlage src/arena-templates/card.js statt CardArena.vue; Markup wie data/markup/card.html (Website)",
          "Neues Specimen anwendungen: Schnellzugriff, Zitat, Tarif, Kennzahl und Galerie — die Muster der frueheren Arena aus card-recipes.json",
          "pipeline.scss ohne scss/scss/05-atoms/_card.scss (Datei gibt es nicht; die Karte liegt ganz in 06-molecules)",
          "Specimens action und surface-adaptation nennen ihre Kompositionen (composes: button — Knoepfe im Fuss; section — die Section-Flaechen base/muted/accent)"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "migratedFrom": "card-recipes.json (v1.0.0)",
    "layer": "molecule",
    "pipeline": {
      "scss": [
        "scss/scss/06-molecules/_card.scss"
      ],
      "story": "stories/molecules/card.stories.js",
      "arena": "apps/theme-configurator/src/components/laboratory/RecipeArena.vue",
      "drupal": [],
      "docs": "docs/card-docs.html"
    }
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "element": ".nc-card"
    },
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "media",
        "element": ".nc-card__media",
        "optional": true,
        "description": "Bild, Video oder Platzhalter. Standard aspect-ratio 3:2."
      },
      {
        "name": "content",
        "element": ".nc-card__content",
        "optional": false,
        "description": "Freier Inhaltsbereich, flex-grow: 1, Padding via Token."
      },
      {
        "name": "footer",
        "element": ".nc-card__footer",
        "optional": true,
        "description": "Aktionen, Meta. margin-top: auto, immer am unteren Rand."
      }
    ],
    "convenience": [
      {
        "name": "kicker",
        "element": ".nc-card__kicker",
        "slot": "content",
        "description": "Eyebrow/Badge-Text (uppercase, xs, secondary)"
      },
      {
        "name": "title",
        "element": ".nc-card__title",
        "slot": "content",
        "description": "Hauptueberschrift, konsumiert --nc-card-title-* Tokens"
      },
      {
        "name": "title-link",
        "element": ".nc-card__title-link",
        "slot": "content",
        "description": "Stretched Link im Titel, ::after { inset: 0 }"
      },
      {
        "name": "description",
        "element": ".nc-card__description",
        "slot": "content",
        "description": "Fliesstext, konsumiert --nc-card-description-* Tokens"
      },
      {
        "name": "meta",
        "element": ".nc-card__meta",
        "slot": "content",
        "description": "Metadaten-Zeile (flex row, tertiary, xs)"
      },
      {
        "name": "icon",
        "element": ".nc-card__icon",
        "slot": "content",
        "description": "Icon, Groesse via --nc-card-action-icon-size"
      },
      {
        "name": "input",
        "element": ".nc-card__input",
        "slot": "content",
        "description": "Hidden input (radio/checkbox) fuer Selectable (sr-only)"
      },
      {
        "name": "footer-action",
        "element": ".nc-card__footer-action",
        "slot": "footer",
        "description": "Button im Footer, z-index: 1 ueber title-link"
      },
      {
        "name": "summary",
        "element": ".nc-card__summary",
        "slot": null,
        "description": "Summary-Element fuer Expandable (details/summary)"
      },
      {
        "name": "expand-icon",
        "element": ".nc-card__expand-icon",
        "slot": null,
        "description": "Chevron-Icon, rotiert bei [open]"
      },
      {
        "name": "details-content",
        "element": ".nc-card__details-content",
        "slot": null,
        "description": "Content innerhalb von details"
      }
    ],
    "domNotes": [
      "Root-Element haengt vom Behavior ab: <article> (static), <a> (navigational-entire), <label> (selectable), <details> (expandable).",
      "Title-Link (navigational-partial): ::after { position: absolute; inset: 0 } fuer Stretched Link.",
      "Selectable: Hidden <input> (sr-only), :has(:checked) fuer Selected-State.",
      "Footer-Actions haben z-index: 1 ueber dem Stretched Title-Link.",
      "Skeleton-State via --skeleton Modifier auf Root — kein JS noetig."
    ]
  },
  "axes": {
    "behavior": {
      "label": "Behavior",
      "description": "Interaktionsmodell der Card",
      "values": {
        "static": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "elementHint": "article"
        },
        "navigational": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--navigational",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "interactive"
          ],
          "elementHint": "a",
          "renderHint": "navigational"
        },
        "selectable": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--selectable",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "selectable"
          ],
          "elementHint": "label",
          "renderHint": "selectable"
        },
        "expandable": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--expandable",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "expandable"
          ],
          "elementHint": "details",
          "renderHint": "expandable"
        },
        "action": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--action",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "action"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "pattern": {
      "label": "Pattern",
      "description": "Visuelles Layout-Muster der Card",
      "values": {
        "standard": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": []
        },
        "preview": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--preview",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "preview"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "media": true
          }
        },
        "featured": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--preview nc-card--featured",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "preview"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "media": true
          },
          "renderHint": "featured"
        },
        "summary": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--summary",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "summary"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "media": true
          }
        },
        "status": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--status",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "status"
          ]
        },
        "horizontal": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--horizontal",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "slotConfig": {
            "media": true
          },
          "renderHint": "horizontal"
        }
      }
    },
    "statusLevel": {
      "label": "Status Level",
      "description": "Farbe des Status-Indikators (nur fuer pattern: status)",
      "values": {
        "none": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": []
        },
        "success": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--status-success",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "status"
          ]
        },
        "warning": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--status-warning",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "status"
          ]
        },
        "danger": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--status-danger",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "status"
          ]
        },
        "info": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--status-info",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "status"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "context": {
      "label": "Layout-Kontext",
      "description": "Kontextueller Kontext der Card innerhalb eines Grid/Section-Layouts",
      "values": {
        "default": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "description": "Standard-Kontext (Grid mit spacing-06 Gap, 3 Spalten)."
        },
        "tight": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--tight",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "context-tight"
          ],
          "description": "Enger Grid (compact, gap <= spacing-04). Padding spacing-04, Titel fs-lg, Beschreibung paragraph-s (eine Stufe kleiner)."
        },
        "display": {
          "modifier": "nc-card--display",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "context-display"
          ],
          "description": "Breiter/hervorgehobener Kontext (pair grid, featured). Padding spacing-08, Titel fs-2xl (eine Stufe groesser). Keine Flaechenregeln."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "hover",
      "focus-visible",
      "active",
      "disabled",
      "selected",
      "open",
      "skeleton"
    ],
    "precedence": [
      "skeleton",
      "disabled",
      "selected",
      "open",
      "active",
      "focus-visible",
      "hover",
      "default"
    ],
    "interactive": true,
    "rules": [
      {
        "state": "hover",
        "onlyWhen": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "navigational",
              "selectable",
              "expandable",
              "action"
            ]
          }
        },
        "effects": [
          "shadowElevate",
          "borderHighlight"
        ]
      },
      {
        "state": "focus-visible",
        "onlyWhen": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "navigational",
              "selectable",
              "expandable"
            ]
          }
        },
        "effects": [
          "focusRingInset"
        ]
      },
      {
        "state": "active",
        "onlyWhen": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "navigational",
              "selectable"
            ]
          }
        },
        "effects": [
          "scaleDown"
        ]
      },
      {
        "state": "disabled",
        "onlyWhen": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "navigational",
              "selectable",
              "action"
            ]
          }
        },
        "attributes": {
          "aria-disabled": "true"
        },
        "effects": [
          "blockInteraction"
        ]
      },
      {
        "state": "selected",
        "onlyWhen": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "selectable"
            ]
          }
        },
        "tokenGroups": [
          "selectable"
        ],
        "effects": [
          "selectedRing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "state": "open",
        "onlyWhen": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "expandable"
            ]
          }
        },
        "effects": [
          "expandIconRotate"
        ]
      },
      {
        "state": "skeleton",
        "attributes": {
          "aria-hidden": "true"
        },
        "effects": [
          "shimmerAnimation"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "dependencyRules": [
    {
      "id": "accent-surface-override",
      "severity": "warning",
      "trigger": {
        "ancestor": "section",
        "condition": "token-value-matches",
        "token": "nc-section-bg",
        "matches": [
          "var(--fnd-color-accent)",
          "var(--fnd-color-interactive-default)"
        ]
      },
      "effects": {
        "nc-card-bg": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--fnd-color-always-light) 12%, transparent)",
        "nc-card-color": "var(--fnd-color-on-accent)",
        "nc-card-title-color": "var(--fnd-color-on-accent)",
        "nc-card-description-color": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--fnd-color-on-accent) 80%, transparent)",
        "nc-card-border": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--fnd-color-always-light) 20%, transparent)"
      },
      "label": "Accent Surface Override",
      "description": "Section mit Akzent-Hintergrund: Card benoetigt Overlay-BG und On-Accent-Text fuer WCAG-Kontrast."
    },
    {
      "id": "muted-surface-blend",
      "severity": "info",
      "trigger": {
        "ancestor": "section",
        "condition": "token-value-matches",
        "token": "nc-section-bg",
        "matches": [
          "var(--fnd-color-background-muted)",
          "var(--fnd-color-layer-02)"
        ]
      },
      "effects": {
        "nc-card-bg": "var(--fnd-color-background-base)",
        "nc-card-shadow": "var(--fnd-elevation-sm)"
      },
      "label": "Muted Surface Blend",
      "description": "Section mit Muted-BG: Card nutzt base-bg + leichte Elevation fuer Abhebung."
    },
    {
      "id": "tight-grid-context",
      "severity": "info",
      "trigger": {
        "ancestor": "grid",
        "condition": "token-value-lte",
        "token": "nc-grid-gap",
        "threshold": "16px"
      },
      "effects": {
        "nc-card-padding": "var(--fnd-spacing-04)",
        "nc-card-header-padding": "var(--fnd-spacing-04) var(--fnd-spacing-04) 0",
        "nc-card-content-padding": "var(--fnd-spacing-04)",
        "nc-card-footer-padding": "0 var(--fnd-spacing-04) var(--fnd-spacing-04)",
        "nc-card-title-font-size": "var(--fs-lg)",
        "nc-card-description-font-size": "var(--fnd-typography-paragraph-s-font-size)"
      },
      "label": "Tight Grid Context",
      "description": "Grid mit Gap ≤ 16px: Card wechselt zu kompaktem Padding und kleinerer Typografie."
    },
    {
      "id": "few-columns-display",
      "severity": "info",
      "trigger": {
        "ancestor": "grid",
        "condition": "token-value-lte",
        "token": "nc-grid-columns",
        "threshold": "2"
      },
      "effects": {
        "nc-card-padding": "var(--fnd-spacing-08)",
        "nc-card-header-padding": "var(--fnd-spacing-08) var(--fnd-spacing-08) 0",
        "nc-card-content-padding": "var(--fnd-spacing-08)",
        "nc-card-footer-padding": "0 var(--fnd-spacing-08) var(--fnd-spacing-08)",
        "nc-card-title-font-size": "var(--fs-2xl)",
        "nc-card-title-font-weight": "var(--fnd-font-weight-semibold)",
        "nc-card-title-line-height": "var(--lh-heading)"
      },
      "label": "Few Columns Display",
      "description": "Grid mit ≤ 2 Spalten: Card nutzt groesseres Padding und prominentere Typografie."
    }
  ],
  "gridLayouts": {
    "standard": {
      "label": "Standard",
      "columns": 3,
      "minWidth": "280px",
      "gap": "var(--fnd-spacing-lg)",
      "class": "nc-card-grid"
    },
    "compact": {
      "label": "Compact",
      "columns": 6,
      "minWidth": "160px",
      "gap": "var(--fnd-spacing-sm)",
      "class": "nc-card-grid nc-card-grid--compact"
    },
    "pair": {
      "label": "Pair",
      "columns": 2,
      "minWidth": "320px",
      "gap": "var(--fnd-spacing-lg)",
      "class": "nc-card-grid nc-card-grid--pair"
    },
    "links": {
      "label": "Links",
      "columns": 4,
      "minWidth": "200px",
      "gap": "var(--fnd-spacing-md)",
      "class": "nc-card-grid nc-card-grid--links"
    }
  },
  "a11y": {
    "base": {
      "interactive": false,
      "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
      "assertions": [
        "hasAccessibleName",
        "semanticStructure"
      ],
      "note": "Cards sind Container — interaktives Verhalten haengt vom Behavior-Typ ab."
    },
    "overrides": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "navigational"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "href"
        ],
        "note": "Navigational Cards muessen ein gueltiges href-Attribut haben. Bei partial-Navigation: title-link traegt den Link."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "selectable"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "name",
          "value"
        ],
        "note": "Selectable Cards benoetigen name und value auf dem Hidden Input. :has(:checked) steuert den Selected-State."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "expandable"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [
          "aria-expanded"
        ],
        "note": "details/summary bietet native Expansion. Falls custom JS: aria-expanded erforderlich."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "pattern": [
              "status"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-label"
        ],
        "note": "Status-Indikator (Farbe) darf nicht das einzige Signal sein. Textuelle Begleitung oder aria-label noetig."
      }
    ],
    "constraints": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "navigational"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "href"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Link-Card ohne href ist nicht navigierbar."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "selectable"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "name",
          "value"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Selectable-Card benoetigt name + value."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "states": [
            "skeleton"
          ]
        },
        "effects": [
          "blockInteraction"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Skeleton-Cards sind nicht interaktiv."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "constraints": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "navigational"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "href"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Navigational Cards muessen ein Ziel haben."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "behavior": [
              "selectable"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "name",
          "value"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Selectable Cards benoetigen name + value."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "pattern": [
              "status"
            ],
            "statusLevel": [
              "none"
            ]
          }
        },
        "severity": "warn",
        "notes": [
          "Status-Pattern ohne statusLevel hat keinen visuellen Indikator."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "copy": {
      "title": {
        "maxChars": 60,
        "truncation": "line-clamp(2)",
        "note": "Preview-Pattern: Title wird nach 2 Zeilen abgeschnitten."
      },
      "description": {
        "maxChars": 120,
        "truncation": "line-clamp(3)",
        "note": "Preview-Pattern: Description wird nach 3 Zeilen abgeschnitten."
      }
    }
  },
  "styling": {
    "baseClasses": [
      "nc-card"
    ],
    "baseTokenGroups": [
      "basis",
      "spacing",
      "typography"
    ],
    "tokenGroups": {
      "basis": {
        "label": "Basis",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-bg",
          "nc-card-color",
          "nc-card-border",
          "nc-card-radius",
          "nc-card-padding",
          "nc-card-shadow",
          "nc-card-shadow-hover",
          "nc-card-border-width",
          "nc-card-disabled-opacity"
        ]
      },
      "spacing": {
        "label": "Spacing",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-header-padding",
          "nc-card-header-gap",
          "nc-card-content-padding",
          "nc-card-footer-padding",
          "nc-card-footer-gap"
        ]
      },
      "typography": {
        "label": "Typography",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-title-font-size",
          "nc-card-title-font-weight",
          "nc-card-title-color",
          "nc-card-title-line-height",
          "nc-card-description-font-size",
          "nc-card-description-color",
          "nc-card-description-line-height"
        ]
      },
      "interactive": {
        "label": "Interactive",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-transition-duration",
          "nc-card-hover-border",
          "nc-card-nav-color-hover",
          "nc-card-link-decoration",
          "nc-card-link-hover-decoration"
        ]
      },
      "selectable": {
        "label": "Selectable",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-selected-border",
          "nc-card-selected-bg",
          "nc-card-selected-ring-width"
        ]
      },
      "expandable": {
        "label": "Expandable",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-summary-font-weight",
          "nc-card-summary-padding",
          "nc-card-details-content-padding",
          "nc-card-expand-icon-size"
        ]
      },
      "status": {
        "label": "Status",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-status-border-width",
          "nc-card-status-success-border",
          "nc-card-status-warning-border",
          "nc-card-status-danger-border",
          "nc-card-status-info-border"
        ]
      },
      "preview": {
        "label": "Preview",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-preview-media-ratio",
          "nc-card-preview-title-size"
        ]
      },
      "summary": {
        "label": "Summary",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-summary-avatar-size",
          "nc-card-summary-avatar-radius"
        ]
      },
      "action": {
        "label": "Action",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-action-icon-size"
        ]
      },
      "context-tight": {
        "label": "Tight Context",
        "description": "Token-Overrides fuer enge Grid-Layouts (Gap ≤ 16px, viele Spalten)",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-padding",
          "nc-card-header-padding",
          "nc-card-content-padding",
          "nc-card-footer-padding",
          "nc-card-title-font-size",
          "nc-card-description-font-size"
        ]
      },
      "context-display": {
        "label": "Display Context",
        "description": "Token-Overrides fuer hervorgehobene Darstellung (≤ 2 Spalten, Hero-Bereich)",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-card-padding",
          "nc-card-header-padding",
